\[\|Ax_k-\mu_kx_k-b\|_1 \le 10^{-15}.\]
The tests were performed in MATLAB/version R2024a on a PC with an Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9300H CPU @ 2.40GHz processor and 8 GB main memory.

