	We now consider $\h_k(\vrm_p(X;\bullet))$, the $G$-persistence module corresponding to a $G$-metric space $X$ via the $p$-Vietoris-Rips metric thickening filtration; see \Cref{def:VRm}. From \Cref{prop:GdHTGdI} we obtain the following generalization of \cite[Theorem B]{adams2024persistent} to the $G$-equivariant setting:

	\begin{corollary}\label{coro:dHTG-dIG-Katetov}
