\section{Conclusion}

The crowd-sourced particle physics stories from CMSatDESY feature a diverse team of scientists working collaboratively to manage an Instagram account dedicated to sharing our personal stories and experiences. The initiative serves four primary objectives: outreach, science communication, training for local individuals, and recruitment efforts. The account has shown consistent growth and is successfully reaching the target audiences. Its concept and organisation ensure that it remains sustainable now and in the future, effectively combining diverse expertise with a strategic approach to engaging and educating the public.


