\begin{lemma} Let $X$ be a blade space and $g:X \to X$, where $g(c,x)=(\mu(c),h_c(x))$ and $h_c(0)=0$ for each $c \in C$, be a fiber-injection. Then $g$ is not separated, continuum-wise semi-turbulent.
\end{lemma}

