Let $M$ be the $(A,B)$-zigzag number for $\phi$. Let $c_A \in C$ such that $A \subset \pi_1^{-1}(c_A)$. Then it follows that 
$$g^n(A) \subset \pi_1^{-1}(\mu^n(c_A)) \subset \{\mu^n(c_A) \} \times [0,1]$$ for each $n$.

