\section{Prototype Design and Experiments}\label{sec:Prototype Design and Experiments}
To validate the proposed modeling and control framework in a real-world scenario, a low-cost MHAUV prototype was constructed and tested experimentally.\cite{bi2022nezha,liu2025wukong}

