\end{figure}

For the purposes of cost-effectiveness and ease of reproducibility, the prototype was adapted from a first-person view (FPV) quadrotor aircraft. We developed our flight control program based on the Betaflight platform, utilizing the SPEDIX F405 flight control board. To prevent short circuits, we applied a layer of waterproof silicone to the surface of the control board.

